    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Alert Notification Router\n\nRoutes parsed alerts to appropriate notification channels:\n\n**Critical Alerts:**\n- Slack notification (formatted blocks)\n- Email notification\n- Audit trail logging\n\n**Warning Alerts:**\n- Slack notification only\n- Audit trail logging\n\n**Info Alerts:**\n- Audit trail logging only\n\n**Webhook URL**: /webhook/alert-notification-router",
        "height": 450,
        "width": 350
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configuration Required\n\n1. **Slack Webhook URL**\n   - Set environment variable: SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL\n   - Or update hardcoded URL in HTTP Request nodes\n\n2. **Email Settings**\n   - Configure SMTP credentials in N8N\n   - Set ALERT_FROM_EMAIL and ALERT_TO_EMAIL\n\n3. **Audit Trail**\n   - Ensure audit-trail webhook is active\n   - Or replace with file/database storage",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 350
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-2",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
